{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:baca4dfc0ff28b03388d401f1b6dd19901f0ccae7140a25d5998c43e2943d1e0",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02:1_2_043_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75ee6b78cea05754105c4eb7f98f36173254ddf6770876b4ae0aef866e840bef",
      "text": "圣地巡礼为他而行",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02:1_2_043_02_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62819e24157b7b6a4afe30014effd5e1ae9945236f2b8df768ec45f5ce75d434",
      "text": "某个休息日，一希受到凉和大吾的邀请，\n希望他“能陪他们一天”。在完全不知道要去哪里的情况下，\n到达集合地点的一希从凉和大吾口中得知，\n他们要举办一场“一希先生限定巡礼”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02:1_2_043_02_a:cmd-000019:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b09bcd6e18d66980a219b2c252065efab172f9d4ca056860b35d17112afe537",
      "text": "第2话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02:1_2_043_02_a:cmd-000019:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75ee6b78cea05754105c4eb7f98f36173254ddf6770876b4ae0aef866e840bef",
      "text": "圣地巡礼为他而行",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02:1_2_043_02_a:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f46a3770661dda0a7013af705b2238eed8678d8f699c0ee8ef2316f67cd6a3bf",
      "text": "……距离和他们两人碰头的地点还有一段路吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02:1_2_043_02_a:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ccacd1c219c79aeee2ba879d1467704bdad4c4f59bb73db1434908e483e8243",
      "text": "（……凉和大吾说想让我今天陪他们一整天）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02:1_2_043_02_a:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fd59db41ff2b36c285f331fff93f1fa0320cdc9188ccf2ff74b07ebedaf1ac1",
      "text": "（……虽然按照他们说的那样穿了方便步行的衣服\n过来，但……到底要做什么呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02:1_2_043_02_a:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d2dfe77bfffd86ead2ee30c411cdf9b82ff15b50128bb239cc922ad8a222e9d",
      "text": "（……他们一定在筹划着什么有趣的事吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02:1_2_043_02_a:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e435835f0d38dddb0d013f668154efc247efd88aaae654b2d78b09c347dc3d2",
      "text": "一希先生！这边，这边。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02:1_2_043_02_a:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b8208f6250d3f97365058649abb8e198e30607e8592bc460d3aa41285299c3a3",
      "text": "老师～！等你好久啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02:1_2_043_02_a:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e57f18125f04a135f0b825e6845de18cd05b86fca3b325df8455cd60bde28c8",
      "text": "……你们两个，来得真早啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02:1_2_043_02_a:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a75c9947c6b7aa557afd63e810f4e009457364ee03601efea8312f0d8ad05c65",
      "text": "啊哈哈，太期待今天了就早早过来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02:1_2_043_02_a:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aeef976957a176773bedfc32bd01c581dfc165fef07e13626caeb06f0fcd9993",
      "text": "那个，一希先生！……虽然稍微有点早，\n祝您生日快乐！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02:1_2_043_02_a:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:604d0483415cf9aa617b6ea27bbc2b59a321fbf481645790657daf740e53bc00",
      "text": "生日快乐！老师！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02:1_2_043_02_a:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a609e9fa396b9107be019a0d56b0d1c1cb5dfd96799486a7968d5026a8f7dce4",
      "text": "你们两个，谢谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02:1_2_043_02_a:cmd-000133:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:26b02cc8ec623bf97f47ccdcebc493111ead147e7e5e95bcf376072e66b1da8d",
      "text": "那就，凉。\n把礼物送给老师吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02:1_2_043_02_a:cmd-000143:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d69290c3bc5b9f191b7dd2dfd6fc674b561fa829f246558964697b566ce05c73",
      "text": "本来是想在生日当天给的，\n但那天俺们三个人到傍晚都有安排嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02:1_2_043_02_a:cmd-000154:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94c1ec0d032564246d360401c740c6e323abbcd6e14b773ed9935d4af1aed58d",
      "text": "今年的生日礼物就是，\n一希先生限定的特别巡礼！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02:1_2_043_02_b:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a3aa91ed48864d77bc1639c7844aa55de7dc42dd1e3ceb3b8d4a4a08089546b1",
      "text": "因为还要坐交通工具的！老师平时常吃的\n晕车药俺们也准备好咯。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02:1_2_043_02_b:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0821f0bfd27c657947147c9e196c8c086a44b929af24dcdb09c69aa96307cb23",
      "text": "还有……\n俺们亲手做的旅行手册！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02:1_2_043_02_b:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:433c2ff7b862439730a9f395c4af711999e4c4473445ccabfd3b10eee461653e",
      "text": "……旅行手册？\n我可以看看吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02:1_2_043_02_b:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c3e0eab7135bbf0124c363d162784a0708abfe045d94917138ffb36a58b21a3",
      "text": "当然可以！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02:1_2_043_02_b:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0181d0d2fb46d2b19044957fbfd77a1ed65572e4bbc357310f61e9a3d19a4d54",
      "text": "……全都是我喜欢的小说里\n作为原型的地点啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02:1_2_043_02_b:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6f4dc05a25ba08ac2b76f96c9e99beebee8bcf66748dabe824bf6ad03e14ce7",
      "text": "（……我说过有空的话打算去看看，\n他们居然一直记着吗）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02:1_2_043_02_b:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f25b2d7ede1b176275b82f153c722206440f8f0dfdc4255bef34bc844a4fd50",
      "text": "……谢谢你们两个。我很开心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02:1_2_043_02_b:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:24c42ed81f766d62ab6e4464ce9291c529fde389f6ded4d49c23dfdb0f2974fd",
      "text": "哎嘿嘿，您能喜欢我们也超开心的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02:1_2_043_02_b:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e8f5500f60263d6703f145681d5347f3947014b2676f63c4559200639956442",
      "text": "俺们也拜读过小说了嘛。带路就包在俺们\n身上吧！老师准备好了的话，就出发咯！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02:1_2_043_02_c:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2f0d85be314a00dce528058830fed48766097c781ab46089f6b3677001797022",
      "text": "首先，先填饱肚子！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02:1_2_043_02_c:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a156ba303db2f054291dec0043c5aab10b76e0f47c4b4310f382f0d060c833f",
      "text": "……这里，是那部小说主人公经常光顾的\n咖啡馆的原型店铺啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02:1_2_043_02_c:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1d4648a12b2bd555f14f42716770bcb4d56375247d509ab44b65e81ee6b479c",
      "text": "主人公在这里吃饭的时候，恋人打来\n电话的那一幕看得俺心惊肉跳的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02:1_2_043_02_c:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a3f39838eef369ccf03af792dcaa61f59d1a009f198024216144784e3def96f",
      "text": "……啊。本该因病过世的恋人\n在电话另一头说着想要遵守约定，是那个场景吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02:1_2_043_02_c:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4ece93d8af13960c0f35611d16a39f90c3469bca82ea2caae1a0d99b3a6ba72",
      "text": "……依然深爱着恋人的主人公，那份动摇与爱意\n交织的复杂情感被细腻地表现了出来呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02:1_2_043_02_c:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a24e09689792ded621e2a00d6249813c2e48a00493cbd56d9ce142df4ca22e5d",
      "text": "那段展开真揪心啊……不过，\n最后是HE真是太好了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02:1_2_043_02_c:cmd-000148:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:baa3a8ef3e0cfb6ce8af8c31e5da27f9aea6a75510f7b6f86f984a7304e93d47",
      "text": "……这里，是那部故事取材的废弃学校吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02:1_2_043_02_c:cmd-000152:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1840182fe50324f73d3e68028fc3e2ddc81853c5fb07fe747413d2b239d82429",
      "text": "……虽说是大白天，但很有氛围呢。\n感觉像误入了小说里的世界一样。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02:1_2_043_02_c:cmd-000171:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:adf42558056ad9cc4cb3b0c40839930fa7ed03d9281db36781e0e2d761d488c4",
      "text": "除了俺们之外一个人都没有呢。\n明明只要预约，谁都可以进来的说。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02:1_2_043_02_c:cmd-000186:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:597d6aa07bee5e85e8dfba3ecc1fd175cc26be11aa9df13f26f467b64e0ae632",
      "text": "……嗯？怎么了？凉，害怕了吗？\n那样的话，别勉强，我们出去吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02:1_2_043_02_c:cmd-000195:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9a6ece6f8ba5bfc2e3d349deb02756400b4c7e01a6e9ee90271864a9d5db4a3",
      "text": "哪有！现在还是大白天呢……\n没那么害怕啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02:1_2_043_02_c:cmd-000200:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc8c7e1c39bd34b37158c73e1a7807b58f55276ec4a67feb933c5e0fccef2f7e",
      "text": "但是，你们两个绝对不能离开我身边哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02:1_2_043_02_c:cmd-000208:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c15b6e2d47851212aae1e3473846e3b2b0ed33a0d66adb798f14e5092ceaafc",
      "text": "……这让我联想到作品里主人公的朋友，\n明明很害怕却还要努力逞强的样子呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02:1_2_043_02_d:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d449dbe4c4e9b700f726e84773cbace89e9751f5ac099302a3c85a4436a2825e",
      "text": "到了！\n最后一个目的地就是这里。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02:1_2_043_02_d:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:232fbd746611ef8bcf0b2ee0ebe254a5d0a1c6b46dfa5389c122a45d46f8e52a",
      "text": "……是那部青春小说里，主人公居住的\n住宅区的原型地点吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02:1_2_043_02_d:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b45f871f08c9ac6dcff25d070196b7530c3f76e132bea188eab0024d01094ada",
      "text": "……在最后一幕向朋友们说着“明天见”\n然后告别的地方。选这里作为最后一站啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02:1_2_043_02_d:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a5b8e29d29f09cdcf32d7cece6cfdc0dace03e15941a4fa369b674a0a5b3f04b",
      "text": "是的！我就知道一希先生一定能\n察觉到的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02:1_2_043_02_d:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63cd75b0b7bfad9ed943a9688a9f1d96c96e2e4de4a7ca5965492b3de41ed89b",
      "text": "那可是个令人印象深刻又清爽的结局呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02:1_2_043_02_d:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58055722f80d5d69a37e2745dee20f514f5a406b4e8c385442bf18ac7b35e7f3",
      "text": "……啊。正因为作为主人公的成长物语也有着很高的完成度，\n才格外凸显出的、极好的结局。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02:1_2_043_02_d:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5bb60037ff8c0e6612f7b78a1c0b45e75a3aeebf5877db6aeb4f42cbd7b23ca3",
      "text": "……我也非常喜欢那个最后一幕。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02:1_2_043_02_d:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b4402723cb22ed48d837ae753582f99192c012b5bec1ae0e82dbcb353269487a",
      "text": "我也很喜欢。所以，想用同样的举动\n来作为结束呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02:1_2_043_02_d:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6f2d9c82ba67d2cbc5903233b78180d5f500ea8a4915a25d8f2686bc5dce8c9",
      "text": "……从你们两人那里得到了非常棒的\n生日礼物。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02:1_2_043_02_d:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e16ebab9d38e363061aee83b0345b0009c938589e7c225342fd5b912b2bf553c",
      "text": "……再次谢谢你们。今天一整天都很开心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02:1_2_043_02_d:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:abf5834e4cff3a391f2708b3d6e04e6591f5321cb08cc25e348614c679fdf8e0",
      "text": "您能开心，我们也觉得好高兴。\n对吧，大吾君！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02:1_2_043_02_d:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56cdd5bfb7fc9c7d1ab2386bccee9c6e477a5d3e8ca646bc720f95869887e613",
      "text": "嗯。而且生日当天还要开派对呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02:1_2_043_02_d:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cedae5d6babc94c7534b5901bb06defa2ed13e895038bca375fa3286ffe3b952",
      "text": "嗯！\n派对也要大家一起开开心心地办哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02:1_2_043_02_d:cmd-000122:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d49d8697c1ec11da5a4f156001a36e235499a060480186154a215aa877b73f19",
      "text": "……你们的心意让我很高兴。\n谢谢，我很期待。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02:1_2_043_02_e:cmd-000020:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0caba00123987c65267cb553eff1c391af5c1350a25058166325804f0b0c7b21",
      "text": "生日当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02:1_2_043_02_e:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29c5a65613cd7d11e1523dd90ac73e8bacc51ff01b52ff550c868ff10d8750d5",
      "text": "一希先生，祝您生日快乐！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02:1_2_043_02_e:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7df34ebaf1d2d4a90e8b6d3bdbda3292e4d9bca757b8d2cb833e97859471c3cd",
      "text": "恭喜你，老师！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02:1_2_043_02_e:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ae5491aca4789ebd4ff6de49bd196f3f9aacb6770b32e57736b2efc8f0a2b7e",
      "text": "恭喜您，一希先生。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02:1_2_043_02_e:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8da963d5d9050603b0577a63ad40ca0a388a4dbe6ad17915b42cf3ba58f88817",
      "text": "……谢谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02:1_2_043_02_e:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f28006fb08a6c2801827517d196becb993ca85f13eda824945cf2bd6be74cfb",
      "text": "大家，今天的碰头会也辛苦了。\n请尽管点自己喜欢吃的东西吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02:1_2_043_02_e:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5f3b87d53100448f122bf9ee4e4387314e0e0b438212c798a48cd191b7cc9462",
      "text": "毕竟是一希先生的生日，蛋糕一定要点！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02:1_2_043_02_e:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96f4fe38511e025ca98b07b2612cc89b2a24b1d8dc22aeceed62ca6c89f8f53d",
      "text": "噢，说得对！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02:1_2_043_02_e:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:863b8b07c280de68340c5291704188d3db9c20f752c75af6ecc0bc645f44e98f",
      "text": "太棒了！\n还有其他想吃的请尽管提出来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02:1_2_043_02_e:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a075e7ff37efc7fb50fc0a6aeb9b21817ab4575e3eab84e75f83bf6164e491b",
      "text": "……啊。能得到大家的祝福，\n今年也度过了一个令人难忘的生日。谢谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
